{
    "title": "PCH Wordmania - Word Games",
    "description": "Do you love word games and puzzles? How about playing for real prizes and rewards? If you answered yes to both questions then PCH Wordmania is the word game for you! Play fun word games and earn chances to win prizes today! The best new word game is here, brought to you by Publishers Clearing House and Steve Harvey. Experience a unique rewarded twist on word games to earn chances to win REAL PRIZES for free by solving word puzzles! Play to win chances at CARS, CASH, AND OTHER HUGE PRIZES! Anyone can win every week!\r\n\r\nIf you enjoy spelling words and creative wordplay, test your skills with challenging word games to earn a chance to win prizes. Experience fun word games and score big with PCH Wordmania. Connect letters to create words, solve word puzzles, and claim entries which can be redeemed to win prizes. Earn even more tokens through new word game speed rounds! Find as many words as you can before the timer ends! Experience challenging timed crossword puzzles with Crossword Countdown, or guess the words before time expires with Mystery Words.\r\n\r\n10 fun word puzzles are waiting to be solved within each uniquely themed level. Shuffle and link letters to build words and complete the word puzzle. Unlock surprise treasure chests filled with entries to redeem for real prizes. Every word game is easy to play and easy to KEEP PLAYING! In those rare moments where you get stuck, word hints are available as well to keep the word puzzle game fun going!\r\n\r\nComplete word puzzles with the chance to win real money and other big prizes with PCH Wordmania!\r\n\r\nPlay fun word games and win even MORE! Every Monday night we announce our Grand Prize Winner right in the app and introduce the next Weekly Grand Prize. This week\u2019s drawing is coming up fast \u2013 so make sure you get in on word game action before time runs out!\r\n\r\nJumpinto the word puzzle craze with PCH Wordmania, a rewarding twist on classic word games where anyone can be a winner!\r\n\r\nSOLVE WORD PUZZLES, WIN BIG, and download PCH Wordmania today!\r\n\r\nPCH Wordmania Features:\r\n\r\nFUN WORD GAMES & PUZZLES!\r\n- Link/shuffle letters & create words in fun word games\r\n- Solve uniquely themed word puzzles\r\n- Find as many words as you can in Speed Rounds\r\n- Now featuring crossword puzzles and mystery word games\r\n- Word games that will test your word building skills\r\n- Claim entries & redeem for real rewards! \r\n- Challenge your word puzzle skills with Daily Challenges!\r\n\r\nPLAY AND WIN PRIZES\r\n- Play word games for chances to win prizes\r\n- DAILY PRIZES GUARANTEED! There will be WINNERS of daily games with real prizes valued at hundreds to thousands of dollars\r\n- Win 25,000 Tokens by completing word games in Daily Challenges!\r\n- Unlock Treasure Chests win BIG with extra Token Rewards & BONUS entries\r\n- WIN CHANCES AT REAL PRIZES AND REWARDS LIKE GIFT CARDS, ELECTRONICS\u2026 EVEN A CAR! You don\u2019t need many Tokens to claim entries & win!\r\n\r\nLike Steve always says, \u201cYou need to be in it to win it!\u201d \u2013 so what are you waiting for? Download PCH Wordmania, play fun word games and be our next big winner!\r\n\r\nDownload the best word puzzle game out there today with PCH Wordmania! Spelling words has never been more fun and rewarding!\r\n\r\nRemember, after you install PCH Wordmania, turn on your Push Notifications so you never miss a live event or chances to earn rewards!\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nTo opt out of targeted ads, the DAA AppChoices tool is available at https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.DAA.appchoices&hl=en",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you love word games and puzzles? How about playing for real prizes and rewards? If you answered yes to both questions then PCH Wordmania is the word game for you! Play fun word games and earn chances to win prizes today! The best new word game is here, brought to you by Publishers Clearing House and Steve Harvey. Experience a unique rewarded twist on word games to earn chances to win REAL PRIZES for free by solving word puzzles! Play to win chances at CARS, CASH, AND OTHER HUGE PRIZES! Anyone can win every week!<br><br>If you enjoy spelling words and creative wordplay, test your skills with challenging word games to earn a chance to win prizes. Experience fun word games and score big with PCH Wordmania. Connect letters to create words, solve word puzzles, and claim entries which can be redeemed to win prizes. Earn even more tokens through new word game speed rounds! Find as many words as you can before the timer ends! Experience challenging timed crossword puzzles with Crossword Countdown, or guess the words before time expires with Mystery Words.<br><br>10 fun word puzzles are waiting to be solved within each uniquely themed level. Shuffle and link letters to build words and complete the word puzzle. Unlock surprise treasure chests filled with entries to redeem for real prizes. Every word game is easy to play and easy to KEEP PLAYING! In those rare moments where you get stuck, word hints are available as well to keep the word puzzle game fun going!<br><br>Complete word puzzles with the chance to win real money and other big prizes with PCH Wordmania!<br><br>Play fun word games and win even MORE! Every Monday night we announce our Grand Prize Winner right in the app and introduce the next Weekly Grand Prize. This week\u2019s drawing is coming up fast \u2013 so make sure you get in on word game action before time runs out!<br><br>Jumpinto the word puzzle craze with PCH Wordmania, a rewarding twist on classic word games where anyone can be a winner!<br><br>SOLVE WORD PUZZLES, WIN BIG, and download PCH Wordmania today!<br><br>PCH Wordmania Features:<br><br>FUN WORD GAMES &amp; PUZZLES!<br>- Link/shuffle letters &amp; create words in fun word games<br>- Solve uniquely themed word puzzles<br>- Find as many words as you can in Speed Rounds<br>- Now featuring crossword puzzles and mystery word games<br>- Word games that will test your word building skills<br>- Claim entries &amp; redeem for real rewards! <br>- Challenge your word puzzle skills with Daily Challenges!<br><br>PLAY AND WIN PRIZES<br>- Play word games for chances to win prizes<br>- DAILY PRIZES GUARANTEED! There will be WINNERS of daily games with real prizes valued at hundreds to thousands of dollars<br>- Win 25,000 Tokens by completing word games in Daily Challenges!<br>- Unlock Treasure Chests win BIG with extra Token Rewards &amp; BONUS entries<br>- WIN CHANCES AT REAL PRIZES AND REWARDS LIKE GIFT CARDS, ELECTRONICS\u2026 EVEN A CAR! You don\u2019t need many Tokens to claim entries &amp; win!<br><br>Like Steve always says, \u201cYou need to be in it to win it!\u201d \u2013 so what are you waiting for? Download PCH Wordmania, play fun word games and be our next big winner!<br><br>Download the best word puzzle game out there today with PCH Wordmania! Spelling words has never been more fun and rewarding!<br><br>Remember, after you install PCH Wordmania, turn on your Push Notifications so you never miss a live event or chances to earn rewards!<br><br>---<br><br>To opt out of targeted ads, the DAA AppChoices tool is available at https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.DAA.appchoices&amp;hl=en",
